    "overview": "The site is the desk an overseas forwarder hands Korea-origin cargo to: calm, accountable and operational. Dark navy carries the authority, bronze marks the route and the next action, and paper keeps the working detail readable. Everything on the page should help a partner decide they can rely on this desk, so precise execution detail always beats decoration or repeated badges.",
